Local SQLite catalog migrations.

From the project root:
  uv run alembic upgrade head
  uv run alembic current
  uv run alembic check

Override the project-relative or absolute file path:
  uv run alembic -x database_path=data_processed/database/test.sqlite3 upgrade head

The environment reuses backend.app.database SQLite connection settings.
Downgrade to base deletes all catalog tables and their contents.
